36
00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:42.299
Bryon Mackay: And it couldn't exist, because we didn't have a good way of doing it, and now we do, with phones.

37
00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:48.989
Bryon Mackay: We are at… the early mobile stage of AI right now.

38
00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:59.959
Bryon Mackay: There are a lot of things we are still trying to figure out, every single day, about how to use this, how to build with this, and I… it's my opinion that we are not thinking big enough.

39
00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:16.059
Bryon Mackay: That there is… at some point, someone's gonna hit it, and it's gonna nail a concept, and suddenly it's gonna just absolutely explode all over again. Or we're gonna realize the great power and capabilities that we have with these applications. And the application will probably change.

40
