42
00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:42.060
Bryon Mackay: I don't know the answers, I don't think anybody does quite yet, but I do feel like we're in those early stages, just like we were in mobile, where we're transitioning from what we can do right now

43
00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:47.180
Bryon Mackay: To what we can actually really do once we really harness this and think about it differently.

